  "case": "lint-post-normalize-error-blocks",
  "clause": "DESIGN R3.3 \u00a76.2 L481 post-N unresolved errors block; L474 draft policy at each lint stage; \u00a710.1 L735 report records attempted candidate diagnostics",
  "derivation": "The quiet fixture with one changed policy row: profile:task-named in the post-normalize draft record becomes error/integrity while profile:task-named-pre-normalize stays warn/readiness. task-create with key kp and the empty value stages an unnamed bpmn:Task: the pre-normalize stage observes it with a warning (no block), N writes nothing, the post-normalize stage reports task-named as an unresolved error, so the batch refuses with the rule's own code task-name-missing (first unresolved error entry in profile-report/2 order, harmonization C19). Report and diagnostics hold both stage entries; nothing is committed.",
